## 5. Concrete Example — Before and After

### Before (incorrect — portfolio state in narrative)

```
earnings_optimism (NVDA):
"Amazon 1M chip deal and Planet Labs record revenue add two fresh
demand-side confirmations. Averaging down initiated at $178.56.
New average cost $185.20, new stop-loss $166.68."
```

### After (correct — market intelligence only)

```
earnings_optimism (NVDA):
"Amazon 1M chip deal and Planet Labs record revenue add two fresh
demand-side confirmations. Bank of America $1T+ trajectory, China AI
ecosystem, Thinking Machines investment remain active. NVDA trading
near $178 — oversold relative to fundamentals given macro selloff
context. Thesis fully intact. No exit signals."
```

The stop-loss, avg cost, and trade confirmation are removed. Price level ($178) is retained as market context, not personal portfolio data.

